('74', 'HPU-20260811-0002', '51', 'RESEARCH UNIT', 'Research Unit', 'astmmc.research@gmail.com', '2026-08-11', '2026-08-11', '20260811_105828_f7dc425681_CARES-BC_posters_for_printing.pdf', '[\"Graphic Design\"]', 'CARES Project', 'For Data Survey Online', '2026-08-11 10:57:00', NULL, '0', NULL, '1', NULL, '1', '[\"Digital Ad\"]', '', '[\"Full Color\"]', '[\"Digital File\"]', '', '1', NULL, '', NULL, '', '0', '0', '', NULL, '', '0', 'Request permission to upload in ASTMMC Official Page \r\n\r\nâœ¨ ð’€ð‘¶ð‘¼ð‘¹ ð‘½ð‘¶ð‘°ð‘ªð‘¬ ð‘ªð‘¨ð‘µ ð‘´ð‘¨ð‘²ð‘¬ ð‘¨ ð‘«ð‘°ð‘­ð‘­ð‘¬ð‘¹ð‘¬ð‘µð‘ªð‘¬! ðŸŒ¸\r\nð‘¨ð’“ð’† ð’šð’ð’– ð’‚ ð’˜ð’ð’Žð’‚ð’ ð’‚ð’ˆð’†ð’… 25 ð’šð’†ð’‚ð’“ð’” ð’ð’“ ð’‚ð’ƒð’ð’—ð’† ð’ð’Šð’—ð’Šð’ð’ˆ ð’Šð’ ð‘»ð’‚ð’ð’…ð’‚ð’ˆ ð‘ªð’Šð’•ð’š?\r\nIf yes, we\'d love to hear from you! ðŸ’—\r\nThe ð—–ð—”ð—¥ð—˜ð—¦-ð—•ð—– ð—£ð—¿ð—¼ð—·ð—²ð—°ð˜ is inviting eligible women to participate in a short survey about breast cancer screening. Your responses will help us better understand the needs of women in our community and contribute to improving breast cancer screening services.\r\nYou are eligible if you are:\r\nâ€¢ 25 ð˜†ð—²ð—®ð—¿ð˜€ ð—¼ð—¹ð—± ð—¼ð—¿ ð—®ð—¯ð—¼ð˜ƒð—²\r\nâ€¢ ð—–ð˜‚ð—¿ð—¿ð—²ð—»ð˜ð—¹ð˜† ð—¿ð—²ð˜€ð—¶ð—±ð—¶ð—»ð—´ ð—¶ð—» ð—§ð—®ð—»ð—±ð—®ð—´ ð—–ð—¶ð˜ð˜†\r\nâ€¢ ð—ªð—¶ð—¹ð—¹ð—¶ð—»ð—´ ð˜ð—¼ ð—½ð—®ð—¿ð˜ð—¶ð—°ð—¶ð—½ð—®ð˜ð—² ð—¶ð—» ð˜ð—µð—² ð˜€ð˜‚ð—¿ð˜ƒð—²ð˜†\r\nðŸ“± If you\'re eligible, simply scan the QR code on the poster or click the link below to participate: \r\n[Bisaya survey questionnaire]\r\nhttps://uantwerpen.eu.qualtrics.com/.../SV_5uOQaOmEmWiFO3c\r\n[English survey questionnaire]\r\nhttps://uantwerpen.eu.qualtrics.com/.../SV_dik09BQ53xlL2vA\r\nð‘²ð’ð’ð’˜ ð’”ð’ð’Žð’†ð’ð’ð’† ð’˜ð’‰ð’ ð’’ð’–ð’‚ð’ð’Šð’‡ð’Šð’†ð’”? \r\nPlease share this post with your family, friends, neighbors, or colleagues who may be interested. Your share could help us reach more women in our community.\r\nð‘¬ð’—ð’†ð’“ð’š ð’“ð’†ð’”ð’‘ð’ð’ð’”ð’† ð’„ð’ð’–ð’ð’•ð’”! âœ¨\r\n#BreastCancerScreening #TandagCity #womenhealthmatters #womenhealthawareness #EarlyDetection #earlydetectioncansavelives #YourVoiceMatters  #CARESBCProject #research #researchcommunity', '2026-08-11', 'ACE R. CABUGA', '2026-08-11', '0', '', 'RECKLYN D. RUAZA, RN - HEPO III', '2026-08-11', '2026-08-11', '2026-08-11', NULL, '0', 'N/A', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Closed', 'Created by RESEARCH UNIT on 2026-08-11 10:58:28\nReviewed by ACE R. CABUGA on 2026-08-11 11:03:40.\nReviewed by JASMIN B. CAONG on 2026-08-11 11:09:13.\nReviewed by ACE R. CABUGA on 2026-08-11 11:34:00.\nAssigned to ACE RAZ CABUGA by System Administrator on 2026-08-27 18:11:51. Priority: Normal.', '2026-08-11 10:58:28', '2026-09-09 10:17:52', '1', '2026-09-09 10:17:52', '13', '3180cf32b35efde364dbf95f9c8fbb379919c793da9dbe999a9bc3afc436718c', '10', NULL, '', 'Normal', '0', NULL),
